# =============================================================================
# Rinda CRM - Frontend Environment Variables
# =============================================================================
# Vite reads .env files ONLY at build / dev-server start. There are no
# runtime env vars for the frontend image (the bundle is plain static files
# served by nginx).
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build-time
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Absolute URL of the Elysia API. The browser calls this directly, so the
# backend must allow this frontend's origin in its CORS allowlist
# (FRONTEND_URLS on the API server).
#
# In dev: also used by Vite's /api proxy (vite.config.ts).
# In prod: must be passed as a Docker `--build-arg VITE_API_URL=...` so it
# gets baked into the JS bundle. Changing it requires a frontend rebuild.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3001   # [REQUIRED in production]
